              : `Route suitability depends on experience level, weather conditions, and your group's capabilities. ${mountain.difficulty_rating === 'Easy' || mountain.difficulty_rating === 'Moderate' ? 'Some routes may be suitable for families with older children who have hillwalking experience.' : 'This mountain is generally recommended for experienced hikers.'} Always assess your group's abilities and check current conditions before setting out.`}
